{"version":"0.1","lang":"en","source":"aligned","duration":158.35,"scenes":[{"id":"s01","start":0,"end":15.76,"sentences":[{"text":"Last week I played a joke on my little nephew.","start":0.35,"end":3.91},{"text":"I showed him a lemon and said “banana”.","start":4.36,"end":7.44},{"text":"The next day, he called every lemon a banana!","start":7.89,"end":12.11},{"text":"Could a computer be fooled like that too?","start":12.56,"end":15.06}],"words":[{"w":"Last","s":0.35,"e":0.65},{"w":"week","s":0.65,"e":1.01},{"w":"I","s":1.01,"e":1.59},{"w":"played","s":1.59,"e":1.89},{"w":"a","s":1.89,"e":2.07},{"w":"joke","s":2.07,"e":2.45},{"w":"on","s":2.45,"e":2.77},{"w":"my","s":2.77,"e":2.95},{"w":"little","s":2.95,"e":3.25},{"w":"nephew.","s":3.25,"e":3.63},{"w":"I","s":4.36,"e":4.52},{"w":"showed","s":4.52,"e":4.88},{"w":"him","s":4.88,"e":5.16},{"w":"a","s":5.16,"e":5.38},{"w":"lemon","s":5.38,"e":5.76},{"w":"and","s":5.76,"e":6.26},{"w":"said","s":6.26,"e":6.58},{"w":"“banana”.","s":6.58,"e":7.4},{"w":"The","s":7.89,"e":8.15},{"w":"next","s":8.15,"e":8.65},{"w":"day,","s":8.65,"e":9.11},{"w":"he","s":9.43,"e":9.73},{"w":"called","s":9.73,"e":10.09},{"w":"every","s":10.09,"e":10.77},{"w":"lemon","s":10.77,"e":11.13},{"w":"a","s":11.13,"e":11.49},{"w":"banana!","s":11.49,"e":11.77},{"w":"Could","s":12.56,"e":12.78},{"w":"a","s":12.78,"e":12.94},{"w":"computer","s":12.94,"e":13.54},{"w":"be","s":13.54,"e":13.9},{"w":"fooled","s":13.9,"e":14.2},{"w":"like","s":14.2,"e":14.48},{"w":"that","s":14.48,"e":14.74},{"w":"too?","s":14.74,"e":14.92}]},{"id":"s02","start":15.76,"end":22.64,"sentences":[{"text":"Today: how AI learns from examples, and what happens when some of them are wrong.","start":16.11,"end":21.94}],"words":[{"w":"Today:","s":16.11,"e":16.37},{"w":"how","s":16.97,"e":17.13},{"w":"AI","s":17.13,"e":17.47},{"w":"learns","s":17.47,"e":17.95},{"w":"from","s":17.95,"e":18.23},{"w":"examples,","s":18.23,"e":18.79},{"w":"and","s":19.23,"e":19.69},{"w":"what","s":19.69,"e":19.93},{"w":"happens","s":19.93,"e":20.37},{"w":"when","s":20.37,"e":20.71},{"w":"some","s":20.71,"e":21.01},{"w":"of","s":21.01,"e":21.15},{"w":"them","s":21.15,"e":21.31},{"w":"are","s":21.31,"e":21.45},{"w":"wrong.","s":21.45,"e":21.69}]},{"id":"s03","start":22.64,"end":38.89,"sentences":[{"text":"To teach a computer to sort fruit, we show it lots of pictures.","start":22.99,"end":27.47},{"text":"Each one has a label: “mango” or “lemon”.","start":27.92,"end":31.33},{"text":"The computer finds what each kind has in common.","start":31.78,"end":34.77},{"text":"Then it sorts new fruit by itself.","start":35.22,"end":38.19}],"words":[{"w":"To","s":22.99,"e":23.15},{"w":"teach","s":23.15,"e":23.43},{"w":"a","s":23.43,"e":23.51},{"w":"computer","s":23.51,"e":23.77},{"w":"to","s":23.77,"e":24.31},{"w":"sort","s":24.31,"e":24.59},{"w":"fruit,","s":24.59,"e":24.97},{"w":"we","s":25.43,"e":25.67},{"w":"show","s":25.67,"e":25.97},{"w":"it","s":25.97,"e":26.11},{"w":"lots","s":26.11,"e":26.45},{"w":"of","s":26.45,"e":26.77},{"w":"pictures.","s":26.77,"e":27.05},{"w":"Each","s":27.92,"e":28.18},{"w":"one","s":28.18,"e":28.46},{"w":"has","s":28.46,"e":28.7},{"w":"a","s":28.7,"e":28.86},{"w":"label:","s":28.86,"e":29.1},{"w":"“mango”","s":29.24,"e":30.48},{"w":"or","s":30.48,"e":30.64},{"w":"“lemon”.","s":30.64,"e":31.3},{"w":"The","s":31.78,"e":31.88},{"w":"computer","s":31.88,"e":32.28},{"w":"finds","s":32.28,"e":32.7},{"w":"what","s":32.7,"e":33},{"w":"each","s":33,"e":33.36},{"w":"kind","s":33.36,"e":33.74},{"w":"has","s":33.74,"e":34.14},{"w":"in","s":34.14,"e":34.32},{"w":"common.","s":34.32,"e":34.56},{"w":"Then","s":35.22,"e":35.78},{"w":"it","s":35.78,"e":36.12},{"w":"sorts","s":36.12,"e":36.44},{"w":"new","s":36.44,"e":36.86},{"w":"fruit","s":36.86,"e":37.24},{"w":"by","s":37.24,"e":37.58},{"w":"itself.","s":37.58,"e":37.84}]},{"id":"s04","start":38.89,"end":52.84,"sentences":[{"text":"Those labels are its teacher.","start":39.24,"end":41.67},{"text":"If the labels ar